agement","s":"Steve Bruffett","x":"However, there was a common theme to these activities, which included the shutdown of the first to final mile service offering, the asset impairment of a group of tractors held for sale and numerous cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SNDR 2019 Q3","e":"sndr","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Bruffett","x":"These charges are shown on the restructuring charges line of our consolidated income statement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SNDR 2019 Q4","e":"sndr","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Bruffett","x":"Given the First to Final Mile shutdown, it makes sense to streamline these metrics from four categories down to two.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SNDR 2019 Q4","e":"sndr","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Bruffett","x":"But on the broader topic of the cost savings that you started with, we've kind of surgically gone through the organization, whether it's operational costs or back-office costs and indirect or direct or however you like to think about those things, and have identified numerous pockets of change…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SNDR 2020 Q1","e":"sndr","d":"2020-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark Rourke","x":"As part of the lasting change on how work is accomplished, we've continued our investments in AI-driven automation, and we've advanced those efforts through the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SNDR 2020 Q1","e":"sndr","d":"2020-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Rourke","x":"For instance, in our for-hire truckload business, 80% of orders now go through an AI-driven enrichment process, where the Quest platform completes missing or incorrect data elements from the customer tender so that it can pass through our algorithm for an acceptance or rejection decision.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SNDR 2020 Q1","e":"sndr","d":"2020-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Bruffett","x":"…elements of the downward slope we experienced during April, and we are expecting second-quarter volumes to remain depressed as it will likely take some time for various industries and regions of the country to pass through the necessary stages to reopen and/or regain scale in their operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SNDR 2020 Q1","e":"sndr","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Bruffett","x":"We've implemented a hiring freeze for non-driver positions, deferred annual merit increases, pursued targeted furloughs and reduced work hours in volume-related areas of the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SNDR 2020 Q4","e":"sndr","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Bruffett","x":"So the impact of First to Final Mile is contained to the restructuring line for both the fourth quarter of 2020 and the fourth quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"SNDR 2021 Q1","e":"sndr","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Rourke","x":"And so that's really at the heart of where do we want to get to that right size, particularly in our network business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/schneider-national-inc-sndr-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"SNDR 2025 Q4","e":"sndr","d":"2026-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Darrell Campbell","x":"Despite last year's tariff-related pull forward creating a more difficult comp, volumes grew for the seventh quarter in a row.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/schneider-sndr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNDR 2025 Q4","e":"sndr","d":"2026-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Rourke","x":"Brian, we also had a little less CapEx this year as we were looking for tariff clarity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/schneider-sndr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNDR 2025 Q4","e":"sndr","d":"2026-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Rourke","x":"We are carrying momentum from our cost savings program, including ramping synergies in our acquired companies, leading intermodal growth, including the recent launch of our intermodal fast track service, heavy dedicated start-up activity, and network earnings improvement into this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/schneider-sndr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNDR 2025 Q4","e":"sndr","d":"2026-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darrell Campbell","x":"We achieved our targeted $400 million of cost savings, including synergies from the common systems acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/schneider-sndr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SNDR 2026 Q1","e":"sndr","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darrell G. Campbell","x":"Our actions include traction on our $40 million cost savings initiatives, where we implemented additional headcount actions, and disciplined execution on our Cowen system integration synergies.","url":"https://www.fool.